ed in multi-part music, they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should be placed in the same positions within each part, or the results are undefined. The page-number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute sets the number of a new page; it is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. Version 2.0 adds a blank-page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute. This is a positive integer value that specifies the number of blank pages to insert before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current measure. It is ignored if new-page is not “yes”. These blank pages have no music, but may have text or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"images specified by the credit element. This is used to allow a combination of pages that are all text, or all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text and images, together with pages of music."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlprint\/attributes-swift.property","role":"symbol","title":"attributes","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attributes","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Attributes","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLPrintV10AttributesV"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPrint/init(id:layout:measureLayout:measureNumbering:partNameDisplay:partAbbreviationDisplay:attributes:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"layout","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLayout","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLLayoutV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"measureLayout","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLMeasureLayout","preciseIdentifier":"s: